# The image is built from the Cargo workspace plus runtime assets only.
*
!rust-toolchain.toml
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/
!crates/
!assets/
!docs/licenses/
!deploy/sherpa-onnx/fetch-static-lib.sh
!deploy/web-tools/install.sh
crates/*/target
crates/*/dist
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
